Package: IdSS
Type: Package
Title: Identification and Analysis of Dynamic Structural Shocks
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kenza", "Benhima", role = "aut"),
    person("Jean-Paul", "Renne", email = "jean-paul.renne@unil.ch",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Teaching and research tools for time-series and structural
    macroeconometric analysis. The package simulates and estimates ARMA, ARMAX,
    ARCH, GARCH, VAR, and VARMA models; computes impulse responses and forecast
    error variance decompositions; and identifies structural shocks through
    recursive orderings, sign and zero restrictions, external instruments,
    forecast-error-variance maximization, and non-Gaussian independent
    components. It also provides the documented datasets used by the companion
    courses "Introduction to Time Series" and "The Identification of Dynamic
    Structural Shocks".
